# Copy to .env (or set in your host's environment) before building for production.
#
# The production origin, with no trailing slash. Every canonical tag, Open Graph
# URL, JSON-LD @id, and sitemap entry is derived from this single value, so it
# must match the domain the site is actually served from. Getting it wrong
# points the whole site's canonicals at a domain you do not control.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://www.sultanmotors.ca

# Formspree form id for the /contact booking form. Defaults to the production
# form in src/data/site.ts. Point this at a scratch form when testing so real
# bookings are not mixed with test traffic.
# VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=xxxxxxxx
